{"id":23016,"name":"烦恼着，幸福着","rarity":5,"path":"Rogue","desc":"巡猎命途专属的光锥，光锥技能仅对该命途生效。","story":"对于一名合格的公司职场人来说，「被压垮」是绝对不容许发生的事情。\\n无论是面对压力还是疲劳，都应该挺直腰杆，迎难而上！\\n除非…是被「它们」压倒在地。\\n\\n<i>「哎呀，不要着急！我只有两只手嘛！」</i>\\n刚结束加班回到家中的少女，被一众毛茸茸的生物压倒在地。\\n它们或许并不能完全听懂她的话语，只顾着将圆圆的脑袋凑近她的手掌。\\n疲惫感从身体中逐渐消失，取而代之的是抚顺毛发带来的温暖舒展。","max_promotion":6,"max_rank":5,"skill":{"id":23016,"name":"一个一个来","desc":"使装备者暴击率提高<color=#f29e38ff><unbreak>#1[i]%</unbreak></color>，追加攻击造成的伤害提高<color=#f29e38ff><unbreak>#2[i]%</unbreak></color>。装备者施放追加攻击后，使目标陷入【温驯】状态，该效果最多叠加<unbreak>#4[i]</unbreak>层。我方目标击中【温驯】状态下的敌方目标时，每层【温驯】使造成的暴击伤害提高<color=#f29e38ff><unbreak>#3[i]%</unbreak></color>。","level":{"1":{"level":1,"param_list":[0.18,0.3,0.12,2]},"2":{"level":2,"param_list":[0.21,0.35,0.14,2]},"3":{"level":3,"param_list":[0.24,0.4,0.16,2]},"4":{"level":4,"param_list":[0.27,0.45,0.18,2]},"5":{"level":5,"param_list":[0.3,0.5,0.2,2]}}},"stats":{"0":{"hp_base":48,"hp_add":7.2,"attack_base":26.4,"attack_add":3.96,"defence_base":21,"defence_add":3.15,"max_level":20,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":5000},{"ItemID":112001,"ItemNum":8}]},"1":{"hp_base":105.6,"hp_add":7.2,"attack_base":58.08,"attack_add":3.96,"defence_base":46.2,"defence_add":3.15,"max_level":30,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":10000},{"ItemID":110121,"ItemNum":4},{"ItemID":112001,"ItemNum":12}]},"2":{"hp_base":182.4,"hp_add":7.2,"attack_base":100.32,"attack_add":3.96,"defence_base":79.8,"defence_add":3.15,"max_level":40,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":20000},{"ItemID":110122,"ItemNum":4},{"ItemID":112002,"ItemNum":8}]},"3":{"hp_base":259.2,"hp_add":7.2,"attack_base":142.56,"attack_add":3.96,"defence_base":113.4,"defence_add":3.15,"max_level":50,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":50000},{"ItemID":110122,"ItemNum":8},{"ItemID":112002,"ItemNum":12}]},"4":{"hp_base":336,"hp_add":7.2,"attack_base":184.8,"attack_add":3.96,"defence_base":147,"defence_add":3.15,"max_level":60,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":100000},{"ItemID":110123,"ItemNum":5},{"ItemID":112003,"ItemNum":6}]},"5":{"hp_